---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="About — Lindsey Liang">
  <main class="about">
    <figure class="about-cover">
      <img src="/media/about/portrait.png" alt="Lindsey Liang portrait" />
    </figure>

    <section class="bio">
      <p>I find myself useful in any room because I've been in many kinds. I started at a startup, <a href="https://marcopoloworldschool.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><em>MarcoPolo Learning</em><span class="ext-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>, wearing every hat: designing and building mobile games, illustrations, animation storyboards, investor decks, TV show concepts. Then agency-side at <em>Madwell</em> and <a href="https://www.wearekettle.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><em>Kettle</em><span class="ext-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>, where I built craft and speed and a sense of what excellence looks like. That's the judgment I mostly use now to critique work. Now at NYT, the teams are bigger, the systems heavier, and the work calls for patience, resilience, and communication as much as design itself.</p>

      <p>Good design, to me, is clarity and high craft with a memorable touch. What I'm looking for is an ambitious idea and a group of strong partners willing to drive in the dark together, figuring out where to go and being honest with each other along the way.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="contact">
      <h3>Contact</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="mailto:ziyunliang522@gmail.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            ziyunliang522@gmail.com<span class="ext-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lindsey-ziyun-liang-a6333884/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            LinkedIn<span class="ext-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: var(--col-center);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--s-12) var(--s-4);
  }

  .about-cover {
    width: min(100vw - 64px, 960px);
    position: relative;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    margin: 0 0 var(--s-8);
  }
  .about-cover img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .bio p { margin-bottom: var(--s-3); }
  .bio em { font-style: italic; }
  .bio a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .contact {
    margin-top: var(--s-8);
  }
  .contact h3 {
    font-size: var(--fs-h3);
    margin-bottom: var(--s-2);
  }
  .contact ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--s-1);
  }
  .contact li {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .contact a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .ext-arrow {
    font-size: 0.85em;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    margin-left: 2px;
    display: inline-block;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
</style>
